29ee93f.mp3","entryId":"18286","definition":"把牛奶、白糖等放入面粉或米粉中搅拌后烤制或油炸而成的零食。","pronunciation":["과자"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一个的。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"f4f2388b9df3c344","term":"봉지","zh":"袋子","audio":"/audio/f4f2388b9df3c344436c.mp3","entryId":"59344","definition":"可以在里面装东西的，用纸或塑料等制成的兜子。","pronunciation":["봉지"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/71fa8f197950bf493e38.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64741-4-6-2","ko":"세 봉지를 하나로 묶어서 천 원에 팔던데.","zh":"好像是三袋装成一捆，卖1000韩元。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"봉지를","meaning":"袋子","explanation":"봉지：袋子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"봉지","audio":"/audio/f4f2388b9df3c344436c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59344","senseId":"1","lemma":"봉지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봉지를","audio":"/audio/a51151cd12a1e6ddfecd.mp3"}},{"text":"하나로","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나로","audio":"/audio/bacd9acb5428eb5cb2f5.mp3"}},{"text":"묶어서","meaning":"结，组","explanation":"묶다：结，组；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"묶다","audio":"/audio/8c1c77b95daf8436ba98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64741","senseId":"4","lemma":"묶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묶어서","audio":"/audio/36715e4496e09bb982be.mp3"}},